		{
			dependencies: ["295CE42425413F4A"]
			description: [
				"The last word in engineering. Draconium ore is deep in the overworld, in the Nether and in the End (the End's is richest)."
				""
				"It goes in three tiers: &bWyvern&f, &6Draconic&f (needs the Ender Dragon's heart) and &cChaotic&f (needs the Chaos Guardian, Act IV)."
				""
				"Its armour does not block damage the usual way: a shield of energy soaks it all up until the shield runs dry. Keep it charged."
